WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.800 --> 00:00:11.800
Get up, Ronin. Aishi, it is this or we starve. Then let's do what must be done, Ronin.

2
00:00:12.880 --> 00:00:15.240
How long does it take you to get up and about?

3
00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:19.540
so

4
00:00:20.140 --> 00:00:27.440
You have finally come to see the truth of things, have you? I am ready to serve. Then come.

5
00:00:28.320 --> 00:00:38.160
Have a seat and enjoy some of this tea with me. What an impeccable day it is.

6
00:00:39.680 --> 00:00:43.600
I never dreamed that such a man would come into my service.

7
00:00:44.280 --> 00:00:48.740
I know this is such a tragedy for you, but do not worry.

8
00:00:49.140 --> 00:00:54.140
You will see how beneficial this will be for both of us.

9
00:00:54.760 --> 00:00:56.240
What is it you wish of me?

10
00:00:58.960 --> 00:01:00.460
Please have some tea.

11
00:01:09.590 --> 00:01:12.190
Come, we are set to a task.

12
00:01:12.810 --> 00:01:15.350
Well, what is the task?

13
00:01:15.350 --> 00:01:19.590
Look, there is a place south of here, hidden from sight.

14
00:01:20.470 --> 00:01:24.130
Shipments pass through it, and we are to make sure they are secured.

15
00:01:24.710 --> 00:01:25.670
What are these shipments?

16
00:01:27.410 --> 00:01:28.410
He did not say.

17
00:01:28.700 --> 00:01:32.439
Coin could command his service, but it could not command his honor.
